### Login

POST http://localhost:8000/users/api/token/
Authorization: Bearer
Content-Type: application/json

{
 "username" : "admin",
 "password" : "admin"
}

> {%
client.global.set("access_token", response.body.access)
 %}

### Get all users

GET http://localhost:8000/users/api/users/
Authorization: Bearer {{ access_token }}
Content-Type: application/json

{

}

### Get a specifc user

GET http://localhost:8000/users/api/users/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{ access_token }}
Content-Type: application/json

### Create a user

POST http://localhost:8000/users/api/users/
Authorization: Bearer {{ access_token }}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="username"

sdaa


--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

sdaa

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="last_name"

sdaa
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="email"

sdaa

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="password"

sdaa

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="password_confirmation"

sdaa

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="department"

Creacion de departmentos

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="video"; filename="Yahir.mov"

< test_content/Yahir.mov


### Create Node Sensor
PATCH http://localhost:8000/sensors/api/sensors/node/d65c3cc6-b555-458c-ac8c-062fdf2b5c60/
Authorization: Bearer {{ access_token }}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Nodo de la casa del robert





### Create sensor data
POST http://localhost:8000/sensors/api/sensors/
Authorization: Bearer {{ access_token }}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

temp=31&hum=43&eco2=751&tvoc=56


### Get sensor data
GET http://localhost:8000/sensors/api/sensors/d65c3cc6-b555-458c-ac8c-062fdf2b5c60/
Authorization: Bearer {{ access_token }}






